---
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="bg-gray-50 border-t border-gray-100 mt-16">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <div>
        <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2 no-underline">
          <img src="/logo.svg" alt="MonoPita" class="w-8 h-8" />
          <span class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">MonoPita</span>
        </a>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-500">あなたの暮らしに、ぴったりのモノを。</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">カテゴリ</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 list-none p-0">
          <li><a href="/category/desk" class="text-sm text-gray-500 hover:text-primary no-underline">デスク周り・PC周辺</a></li>
          <li><a href="/category/kitchen" class="text-sm text-gray-500 hover:text-primary no-underline">キッチン便利グッズ</a></li>
          <li><a href="/category/cleaning" class="text-sm text-gray-500 hover:text-primary no-underline">掃除・収納</a></li>
          <li><a href="/category/smartphone" class="text-sm text-gray-500 hover:text-primary no-underline">スマホ・モバイル</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">サイト情報</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 list-none p-0">
          <li><a href="/about" class="text-sm text-gray-500 hover:text-primary no-underline">運営者情報</a></li>
          <li><a href="/privacy" class="text-sm text-gray-500 hover:text-primary no-underline">プライバシーポリシー</a></li>
          <li><a href="/contact" class="text-sm text-gray-500 hover:text-primary no-underline">お問い合わせ</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-8 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200 text-center">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">&copy; {currentYear} {SITE_TITLE}. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1">当サイトはAmazonアソシエイト・プログラムに参加しています。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
